75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"mRpk0A4u0hnF0lNe1h4hGg","review_id":"-dPamXirDEugd0J0Fg4sMQ","date":"2018-07-30T03:00:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9541351795196533,"text_excerpt":"My new favorite Brunch place for when I am feeling healthy and down and dirty! Ambiance: Located in walking distance from Ochsner Baptist, Bearcat is on an elevated platform that leads into a modern, chic space. There is a nice outdoor patio for warmer days and a resident cute tabby when we were there. Inside, there are couches by the front windows and the back near the bathroom for some relaxation. There are also wooden tables and half booths in the main dining area with a full view of the open kitchen bar. The overall space was just very clean, well lit, and simple with a Seattle hipster vibe. Food: YUM. We got the bottled Guava Mint Green Tea and the Thai Basil Black Tea. While the Gua..."},{"business_id":"mRpk0A4u0hnF0lNe1h4hGg","review_id":"V494ZrbFUiJqT1weMSwG0A","date":"2017-05-29T03:31:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9424017071723938,"text_excerpt":"This place is an awesome and welcome addition to the New Orleans breakfast/brunch scene - I was looking for somewhere to go with my girlfriend and we couldn't decide. Places were either super healthy juice bars or leaned too heavily in the other direction. Thankfully the goodcat/badcat menu here addresses that quite well - and quite tastily. I got the yogurt bowl and a sausage sandwich, my girlfriend got the bananas foster pancakes with a side of sausage. The yogurt bowl was good, although I didn't care for the basil on it (a minority I find myself in). The sausage biscuit sandwich was really good - the bison sausage is delicious and you should absolutely get it. I tried some of the panca..."},{"business_id":"mRpk0A4u0hnF0lNe1h4hGg","review_id":"QZfwUOnFVz0GQEth9JX20A","date":"2019-10-01T18:16:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9418878555297852,"text_excerpt":"I love this spot. I was walking down Freret and decided to stop in. The menu has so much variety! From vegan options to the not so vegan options. I appreciate that it's somewhere where everyone can find something they can enjoy. I decided to try one of their house bottled drink. I opted for the Watermelon Mint Limeade and it was delicious. So refreshing, and flavorful. For my meal I went went the pancakes, which are HUGE!! I kid you not they're absurdly massive but oh so good. I enjoyed the whipped cream topping that came on top. I never really take a food like pancakes to go when I don't finish, but these were too good to pass up. Plus they heated up well the next day which is another plus."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"mRpk0A4u0hnF0lNe1h4hGg","photo_id":"IhNfyHhw7FMZ_NpUvNOAUw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/IhNfyHhw7FMZ_NpUvNOAUw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8750759363174438},{"business_id":"mRpk0A4u0hnF0lNe1h4hGg","photo_id":"SktCEhIhHOT3qB5yxFcXvQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/SktCEhIhHOT3qB5yxFcXvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8734450340270996},{"business_id":"mRpk0A4u0hnF0lNe1h4hGg","photo_id":"tI_-SNn9ZdVHmmBYR30WKg","label":"food","image_url":"/